-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Models
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No model weights are included in or distributed with this repository, and it
does not name any downloadable model. The catalog is supplied by the app, which
downloads the files on the user's request from their original hosts. Each model
has its own license; the app that offers a model is responsible for honoring it,
for example by showing it to the user before the download where it requires that.

Apple Foundation Models (iOS 26+) are part of the operating system and are used
through the app's own Swift bridge.
